SF0097 Trust code revisions.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Case, Nethercott and Olsen and
Representative(s) Lawley
AN ACT relating to the uniform trust code; clarifying the definition of
"qualified trustee"; specifying who is required to receive notice for judicial
proceedings related to trusts; specifying that no rule of perpetuities applies
to noncharitable purpose trusts; specifying when a trustee can reimburse a
person for certain tax costs attributable to the trust; specifying
applicability; and providing for an effective date.
